@startuml
title C2: Medical Devices

package "Medical Devices" {
  [MRI Scanner] --> [DICOM Gateway]
  [ECG Monitor] --> [Bluetooth Adapter]
  [Ultrasound] --> [DICOM Gateway]
  [IoT Hub] <-- [All Devices]
}

[IoT Hub] --> [Message Queue (Kafka)]
[Message Queue] --> [IaC VM] : Stream data
[IoT Hub] --> [Alert System]

note right of [DICOM Gateway]
  Стандарт: DICOM
  Шифрование: TLS
end note

note right of [IoT Hub]
  Принимает:
  - Реальное время
  - Мониторинг состояния
end note

@enduml

